      "result": "Implemented the Rails URL shortener API with PostgreSQL persistence, unique generated/custom codes, click tracking, validation, and the requested JSON responses and redirects.\n\n`sh start.sh` runs pending migrations and starts the server in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`. The README includes startup instructions.\n\nVerified the API over HTTP for creation, lookups, duplicate codes, redirects and single-click increments, listing, unknown codes, invalid inputs, and malformed JSON. Also confirmed Rails eager loading and Ruby/shell syntax checks pass. The temporary verification links were removed.",
